-- Sky Dungeon #2

-- References:
--     - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hgfE0iAolFw
--     - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YV0X2LufyZ8
-- 
-- One Guard Robot Alerty squad per area (206/207, 212/213, 217/218) is called in every
-- 15 seconds of combat while an Alerty of that area lives.
-- 
-- Built on the retail spawn groups of spawn_mob_skdungeon_001_0X (identical to the
-- tw client copy). Patrol robots and Guard Robot Alerty walk their retail path ids,
-- see world_data/Path/DBO_SKDungeon_001_PATH.pth.
-- 
-- TODO: Missing text notifications on some events and mobs speaking
--       when pulled and so on.
-- 
-- Author(s): Tuo, Grender, Zebiru (OpenDBO)


